[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3421.67, "timestamp": "00:57:01", "text": "在事情发生之前就出现了征兆，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3423.589, "timestamp": "00:57:03", "text": "好的，那对我康复后会有帮助。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3426.63, "timestamp": "00:57:06", "text": "我猜也是。所以就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3428.95, "timestamp": "00:57:08", "text": "事物。是的，我喜欢覆盆子，但是我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3430.549, "timestamp": "00:57:10", "text": "现在基本不买那些东西了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3432.39, "timestamp": "00:57:12", "text": "因为我觉得这里不卖这个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3436.39, "timestamp": "00:57:16", "text": "我觉得它是进口的。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3438.789, "timestamp": "00:57:18", "text": "嗯，是的，我希望我们仍然拥有像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3440.789, "timestamp": "00:57:20", "text": "覆盆子茶。那玩意儿太棒了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3443.03, "timestamp": "00:57:23", "text": "那玩意儿太炸了。我当时真的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3449.99, "timestamp": "00:57:29", "text": "包。很奇怪，不是吗？你曾经有过吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3452.23, "timestamp": "00:57:32", "text": "那种感觉就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3454.71, "timestamp": "00:57:34", "text": "你太喜欢这种茶了，以至于你不得不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3458.23, "timestamp": "00:57:38", "text": "把茶包里的东西都取出来？哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3461.67, "timestamp": "00:57:41", "text": "是的。它真的非常好。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3463.589, "timestamp": "00:57:43", "text": "是的。是的。是的。我已经做到了。是的。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3466.87, "timestamp": "00:57:46", "text": "想要那个。这听起来可能很奇怪"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3468.63, "timestamp": "00:57:48", "text": "因为你只是在吮吸树叶而已"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3471.829, "timestamp": "00:57:51", "text": "或许是干果，但就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3474.309, "timestamp": "00:57:54", "text": "就是不一样。你们不"}]